title: "Guarding the Door: Measuring and Hardening Lightweight Full-Stack Defense for an Internet-Exposed MCP Agent Endpoint"
abstract: "A deployed, dependency-free full-stack defense for a single-operator, Internet-exposed Model Context Protocol (MCP) agent endpoint: an admission gate (Guardian), post-authentication content defense (Bastion), and risk-adaptive in-band routing with verifiable result provenance (Mirage)."
